WEBVTT

01:18.440 --> 01:20.240
What's going on?

01:38.260 --> 01:39.890
That's good.

01:48.170 --> 01:49.470
Kiriko!

01:49.470 --> 01:51.100
Hey! Kiri...

01:57.250 --> 01:59.480
I knew it was him!

02:17.900 --> 02:22.400
Seventh Night


02:17.900 --> 02:22.400
Master of the Beasts

02:22.400 --> 02:22.640
Will
the
Phantom
Strike
Again?

02:22.640 --> 02:24.840
Will
the
Phantom
Strike
Again?

02:22.640 --> 02:24.840
How long will this continue?

02:24.840 --> 02:25.370
How long will this continue?

02:25.370 --> 02:28.370
Mayor Kusaka was a dear friend too.

02:28.640 --> 02:31.980
I'm sorry, if only I could have done something.

02:31.980 --> 02:35.440
No, I'm the one who should apologize.

02:36.120 --> 02:39.950
I should have listened to you earlier.

02:40.390 --> 02:42.190
Is your injury better?

02:43.460 --> 02:44.960
See for yourself!

02:44.960 --> 02:47.330
If you hadn't shown up when you did,
I would have...

02:47.330 --> 02:48.800
Ow!

02:48.800 --> 02:55.170
Easy, now. If anything happened to you,
I could never face your father!

02:56.040 --> 02:58.770
I'm hardly a model son.

02:58.770 --> 03:02.440
I just recently learned that my father
worked for Kagura Pharmaceuticals

03:02.440 --> 03:03.980
before joining your company.

03:03.980 --> 03:10.040
At least your encounter with the
Phantom helped the police.

03:10.890 --> 03:12.790
They're really desperate.

03:13.490 --> 03:15.520
The whole city's terrified.

03:15.520 --> 03:21.520
Some schools are making the children
travel in groups. Aren't you worried?

03:21.730 --> 03:22.860
Hmm?

03:22.860 --> 03:24.370
Where's Maya today?

03:24.370 --> 03:27.600
Oh, she went shopping with her mother.

03:27.600 --> 03:34.510
I appreciate your concern for my daughter, but
let's not make your lovely assistant jealous!

03:35.410 --> 03:37.040
Huh?

03:41.020 --> 03:43.780
That was definitely Maya Kuroshio.

03:45.250 --> 03:49.790
I knew her mother was the director,
but I never imagined she was...

03:49.790 --> 03:52.190
Hey, let me out, will you?

03:53.060 --> 03:55.430
I want to wander around a bit.

03:55.800 --> 03:57.770
Oh, all right.

04:24.030 --> 04:25.650
Jin!

04:31.700 --> 04:33.460
It's been so long.

04:34.040 --> 04:36.370
I'm glad you seem well.

04:37.440 --> 04:40.810
What about me?
Did I get more womanly at all?

04:41.480 --> 04:43.270
I threw out the film.

04:47.550 --> 04:49.850
Quit sniffing around the White Bell Society.

04:50.080 --> 04:52.950
Wait! This is yours!

04:52.950 --> 04:55.010
Have you forgotten, Jin?

04:57.160 --> 05:00.030
What's wrong? Did something happen?

05:00.030 --> 05:01.830
Does it have to do with that scar?

05:02.160 --> 05:06.460
C'mon, let's go back to our comrades!
Everyone's worried about you!

05:07.370 --> 05:09.960
About a guy who disappeared two years ago?

05:10.670 --> 05:15.580
You dummy!
Why do you think I snuck in there?

05:18.550 --> 05:22.480
In the end, the world doesn't change.

05:22.950 --> 05:24.580
Huh?

05:29.120 --> 05:33.030
What does carrying a machine gun
have to do with God?

05:38.170 --> 05:39.260
NO ENTRY

05:40.200 --> 05:41.700
The music you mentioned?

05:41.700 --> 05:45.540
The pilot of the project called it the
"Voice of God."

05:48.510 --> 05:49.940
Go ahead.

05:49.940 --> 05:51.570
Right!

06:05.960 --> 06:09.090
The control waves are inaudible
to the human ear.

06:13.940 --> 06:19.530
This will enable us to re-use the defective
goods previously slated for disposal.

06:21.680 --> 06:26.840
Major Isurigi has requested
to meet with you again.

06:27.950 --> 06:29.750
But Father, I...

06:33.050 --> 06:38.080
I've forbidden you to call me that
at work, Mr. Kumashiro.

06:40.760 --> 06:42.790
Please excuse me.

06:52.840 --> 06:55.310
How's the chairman today?

06:55.980 --> 06:59.070
Probably shrinking at phantom
shadows right now.

06:59.480 --> 07:02.310
Oh? Then, we can take it easy.

07:07.820 --> 07:10.260
You surprised me.

07:10.260 --> 07:14.990
I had no idea you knew martial arts!

07:18.870 --> 07:20.540
You don't have to cheer me up.

07:20.540 --> 07:21.540
Huh?

07:21.540 --> 07:24.940
You saw his face, right?

07:25.270 --> 07:28.140
I'll tell you whatever you want to know.

07:31.880 --> 07:34.850
You came to Otomo to find him, right?

07:36.820 --> 07:41.160
He's the one who taught me photography.

07:41.160 --> 07:44.190
Martial arts too, and lots of other stuff.

07:44.190 --> 07:47.630
Ouch! Oops...

07:50.200 --> 07:53.860
Hey! Don't you remember when
Mayor Kusaka was killed?

07:54.270 --> 07:55.300
What?

07:55.300 --> 07:59.470
That scar! You know!
The Skull Man had one, right here!

08:00.640 --> 08:02.310
Don't tell me he's...

08:02.310 --> 08:03.340
Idiot!

08:03.340 --> 08:06.210
How could you say such a thing?!

08:06.210 --> 08:10.650
There's no...
There's no way that's true!

08:10.650 --> 08:12.280
Hey, Kiriko!

09:22.890 --> 09:25.490
The Phantom has made another appearance.

09:25.490 --> 09:27.030
Late last night, Sanzo Osato of the city council
encountered the killer on his way home from work.

09:27.030 --> 09:28.960
Minakami
Restaurant

09:27.030 --> 09:28.960

Late last night, Sanzo Osato of the city council
encountered the killer on his way home from work.

09:28.960 --> 09:30.930
Late last night, Sanzo Osato of the city council
encountered the killer on his way home from work.

09:30.930 --> 09:35.800
For some reason, the masked man
departed without inflicting harm.

09:35.940 --> 09:38.800
The string of incidents is causing
widespread uncertainty.

09:40.340 --> 09:45.280
How awful! Day after day, it's all so horrible!

09:45.280 --> 09:46.910
Excuse me...

09:46.980 --> 09:48.820
Could I please have some more water?

09:48.820 --> 09:50.440
Sure!

09:51.890 --> 09:54.290
The water here sure is good!

09:55.520 --> 09:57.150
Welcome! Oh!

10:02.660 --> 10:04.560
I'll have the special.

10:06.370 --> 10:07.540
One special!

10:07.540 --> 10:09.160
Right!

10:10.770 --> 10:12.400
Have you forgotten?

10:13.070 --> 10:14.870
Have you forgotten who I am?

10:16.410 --> 10:18.840
Oh! Nami!

10:19.550 --> 10:22.250
Well, I'm glad you still remember!

10:22.250 --> 10:25.490
How could I forget?
How many years has it been?

10:25.490 --> 10:27.110
Let's see...

10:27.820 --> 10:29.220
What's with you?

10:29.220 --> 10:31.490
Oh, so you are friends!

10:31.490 --> 10:32.030
Yeah, right!

10:32.030 --> 10:33.390
Oh, we're great friends!
Yeah, right!

10:33.390 --> 10:33.730
Oh, we're great friends!
Get lost!

10:33.730 --> 10:35.360
Nami, take these, please!
Get lost!

10:35.360 --> 10:36.930
Coming!

10:36.930 --> 10:39.430
You scumbag, you know her?

10:39.430 --> 10:41.400
So what if I do?

10:41.400 --> 10:43.340
Introduce me, I'll buy you lunch.

10:43.340 --> 10:44.140
What?!

10:44.140 --> 10:45.770
Thanks for waiting!

10:46.640 --> 10:50.810
Anyway, I'm glad. I thought for
sure you'd forgotten me!

10:50.810 --> 10:53.480
Of course not! But what are
you doing in this place?

10:53.480 --> 10:55.620
There's nothing wrong with this place!

10:55.620 --> 10:58.090
Nami's my niece!

10:58.090 --> 11:01.520
I was surprised when she just appeared
without warning though!

11:01.520 --> 11:03.490
Sorry!

11:03.490 --> 11:05.120
Oh! Is that so?

11:08.200 --> 11:09.700
Oh, please.

11:09.700 --> 11:13.900
This is Shinjo, a weirdo detective
from the Otomo Police.

11:14.100 --> 11:16.190
Oh, you're a police officer?

11:16.670 --> 11:20.040
Day or night, I risk my life for
the public's safety, Ma'am!

11:22.080 --> 11:22.970
Private
Academy
White Bell
Girl's
High School

11:23.180 --> 11:25.650
See you tomorrow!

11:27.520 --> 11:30.420
Good day, ladies. See you tomorrow!

11:37.990 --> 11:40.550
What's come over you?

11:40.860 --> 11:44.060
It's not like you to miss a target.

11:45.600 --> 11:49.060
I don't understand your "justice" anymore.

11:50.570 --> 11:52.070
Two years ago,

11:52.070 --> 11:57.410
the White Bell Society saved you when you
were wounded, fleeing the military police.

11:57.410 --> 11:59.210
You haven't forgotten, have you?

12:00.780 --> 12:05.520
If you leave this job,
you'll be a common fugitive again.

12:05.520 --> 12:08.720
That anti-military gang of yours,
aiding deserters...

12:08.720 --> 12:12.630
I understand Kiriko Mamiya was
a member of that resistance group too.

12:12.760 --> 12:16.800
Such a sweet child, so spirited and sincere.

12:16.800 --> 12:21.560
I certainly wouldn't want to see her
tortured by the military!

12:30.750 --> 12:33.150
Your next target.

12:34.520 --> 12:38.250
He's getting quite chummy with the military.

12:38.920 --> 12:43.220
They have a rendezvous tonight at the
Otomo station switchyard.

12:43.220 --> 12:47.290
Actually, you won't need to intercede tonight.

12:55.170 --> 12:57.160
She asked me to give this to you.

13:01.840 --> 13:06.300
She said you would understand.

13:07.280 --> 13:08.910
Now...

13:09.420 --> 13:11.940
Th-Thank you.

13:20.860 --> 13:22.090
Tonight
at 12
Yasuragi
Park

13:42.650 --> 13:45.850
Come to finish off the one who got away, huh?

13:52.560 --> 13:55.790
I used to have ideals.

13:57.030 --> 14:00.990
But the world didn't change,
and I became tainted.

14:04.670 --> 14:07.900
Tell Kiriko I can't see her again.

14:09.810 --> 14:14.340
Tell her I'm not the man she once knew.

14:18.290 --> 14:23.020
You've got a lot of nerve,
you murdering bastard!

14:26.990 --> 14:28.620
There he is!

14:35.970 --> 14:38.270
What? You're kidding!

14:39.170 --> 14:41.370
Now, of all times!

15:19.950 --> 15:21.740
You're defective, aren't you?

15:37.970 --> 15:44.230
Our next piece will be Richard Wagner's
Tannhäuser Overture.

16:06.890 --> 16:10.420
So, it was you!

16:20.240 --> 16:23.570
Vanish, ephemeral light.

16:24.380 --> 16:28.250
For life is naught but a walk through shadow,

16:28.720 --> 16:32.980
and what follows, nobody knows.

17:04.290 --> 17:06.850
Stop, I'm not the one.

17:31.180 --> 17:34.550
Be not proud.

18:05.150 --> 18:07.200
There you are!

18:10.850 --> 18:13.180
I knew it was you!

18:13.720 --> 18:17.990
What did you do this time?!
Who did you kill?! Tell me!

18:19.590 --> 18:24.460
In the end, a fake can only go so far.

18:25.030 --> 18:28.600
What's that mean?! If you're a fake, then...

18:28.600 --> 18:30.100
Stop looking.

18:30.100 --> 18:36.170
Tatsuo Kagura, you mustn't look...

18:37.410 --> 18:40.900
What are you trying to say?! Hey! Hey!

19:11.710 --> 19:15.880
This is 119. What's the trouble? Hello?

19:40.770 --> 19:42.400
Jin?

19:52.320 --> 19:54.340
No...

19:56.360 --> 19:59.520
It can't be! It can't!

20:06.900 --> 20:08.500
Continue...

20:08.500 --> 20:10.130
Yes...

20:10.370 --> 20:13.270
According to our deceased informant,

20:13.270 --> 20:19.710
GRO involvement was confirmed before
the public found out about him.

20:19.710 --> 20:21.450
Further inquiries suggest a possibility

20:21.450 --> 20:26.180
that it may be Lost Numbers from the
experiments in South East Asia.

20:26.750 --> 20:30.390
GRO that have long been wiped from
the registry are not a concern.

20:30.390 --> 20:35.350
It is he, Mr. Vogout. He is critical.

20:35.530 --> 20:42.100
And you wish to confirm whether this
Phantom might be him, yes?

20:42.100 --> 20:44.910
We're counting on you.

20:44.910 --> 20:46.930
Thank you, until then.

20:47.170 --> 20:48.940
For the Black Phantom!

20:49.210 --> 20:51.580
For the Black Phantom!

20:53.310 --> 20:57.040
I'll be taking a long trip.
Make the arrangements.

20:57.380 --> 20:59.010
Where to?

20:59.450 --> 21:02.120
Japan, Otomo City.

21:03.090 --> 21:12.190
There is only one sky,
though the world is large

21:12.330 --> 21:16.870
When you lose sight of the one you love

21:16.870 --> 21:22.470
Look up at it for strength

21:22.610 --> 21:31.750
The path we walked together
now splits into two

21:31.750 --> 21:40.590
Our tears show how much
we long to meet again

21:40.860 --> 21:45.430
The you of tomorrow will be born tomorrow

21:45.430 --> 21:50.600
Just as the Sun rises after a long night

21:50.600 --> 21:54.610
Throw away all the rest of the dream

21:54.610 --> 21:58.870
And open your arms!

21:59.110 --> 22:03.750
The future is always right before your eyes

22:03.750 --> 22:08.760
Just waiting for you to step forward

22:08.760 --> 22:12.860
Beyond the horizon

22:12.860 --> 22:20.660
A world awaits you, and new encounters

22:24.740 --> 22:25.010
Become an icon, like the patterns of the
foliage in the forest of the lost.

22:25.010 --> 22:28.710
Eighth Night


22:25.010 --> 22:28.710
The Maiden Whispers
in the Moonlight

22:25.010 --> 22:28.710

Become an icon, like the patterns of the
foliage in the forest of the lost.

22:28.710 --> 22:31.180
Eighth Night


22:28.710 --> 22:31.180
The Maiden Whispers
in the Moonlight

22:28.710 --> 22:31.180

There is no return.

22:31.180 --> 22:33.950
Eighth Night


22:31.180 --> 22:33.950
The Maiden Whispers
in the Moonlight

22:31.180 --> 22:33.950

A maiden whispers in the moonlight.

22:33.950 --> 22:37.950
Eighth Night


22:33.950 --> 22:37.950
The Maiden Whispers
in the Moonlight

22:33.950 --> 22:37.950

The veil of terror is about to be lifted.

22:37.950 --> 22:38.320
Eighth Night


22:37.950 --> 22:38.320
The Maiden Whispers
in the Moonlight
